Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1100
Set Height 330
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "cd ~/Documents/oh-my-harness && clear"
Enter
Show

Type `jgrep -t 0.9 "catches an error and silently ignores it" src/loop`
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type `jgrep --diff HEAD~3 "adds or changes a test"`
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
